    "detailed_description": "<strong>Uh oh! Viewers are dropping!</strong><br><br>Become renowned funny-man live streamer <strong>Jerma985</strong> in this upcoming free genre-jumping adventure!<br><br>It is up to you to appease the restless live chat audience and climb your way up to internet-clown fame.<br><br>Hop between multiple in-universe video games\u2014including snippets from the RPG &quot;Paper Jerma&quot; and the psychological horror game &quot;Peep the Horror&quot;\u2014to quench the ravenous hunger of the chat.<br><br>Hijinks will ensue.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Silly references to Jerma985 and the extended Jermaverse<br></li><li> Turn-based &quot;Paper Jerma&quot; RPG gameplay with timing-based attacks<br></li><li> First-person psychological horror<br></li><li> Clown-based vehicular combat<br></li><li> Blackjack (with a rat)<br></li><li> &quot;Story&quot; and &quot;characters&quot; and &quot;jokes&quot;<br></li><li> A large amount of Jerma noises<br></li><li> Is free<br></li><li> Rats</li></ul><br>Disclaimer: This game is unaffiliated with Jerma985, was not commissioned by him, and does not represent his views. This is a completely free fan-project made for fun by fans.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227100/extras/51db43fa18274582c3be74edfa7ba802.poster.avif?t=1752527075\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227100/extras/51db43fa18274582c3be74edfa7ba802.webm?t=1752527075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227100/extras/51db43fa18274582c3be74edfa7ba802.mp4?t=1752527075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
